name: sim.checkCollisionEx
description: Deprecated. Use sim.checkCollision instead
luaSynopsis: int result, list intersections = sim.checkCollisionEx(int entity1Handle, int entity2Handle)
pythonSynopsis: int result, float[] intersections = sim.checkCollisionEx(int entity1Handle, int entity2Handle)
inputs:
1. entity1Handle: handle of entity 1 (can be an object handle or a collection handle)
2. entity2Handle: handle of entity 2 (can be an object handle or a collection handle), or sim.handle_all to check entity1 against all other collidable objects
outputs:
1. result: number of segments returned
2. intersections: array containing the intersection segments between the two entities
replacedBy:
- name: checkCollision, class: collection, file: collection_checkCollision.method
- name: checkCollision, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_checkCollision.method
